    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential Estate Agents are delighted to present 37 Elmwood to the Dublin 15 property market.\r\n\r\nThis well-proportioned family home offers generous living accommodation together with excellent outdoor space, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, families or those looking to establish a home in a well-connected Dublin 15 location.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious living room positioned to the front of the property, with a dining room and extended kitchen located to the rear. A convenient guest WC is also located beneath the stairs.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property comprises two generous double bedrooms, a single bedroom and a family bathroom. The property further benefits from both a large front garden and a substantial rear garden, providing excellent outdoor space with potential for a variety of uses.\r\n\r\nThe property also has the added advantage of a south - facing back garden which is great for those long summer evenings. \r\n\r\nThe location is a major highlight, with a host of amenities and transport links within easy reach. The 39 bus route, Clonsilla Train Station, a selection of primary and secondary schools and Hartstown Shopping Centre are all within walking distance. Blanchardstown Shopping Centre and the area’s major road networks are also easily accessible, while Dublin Airport can be reached conveniently via the N3 and M50.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the accommodation, gardens and excellent location this property has to offer.\r\n\r\nAll information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost care and attention have been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases, some information may have been provided to us by the vendor. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors, or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have."
      },
